{'symbol': 'HAS', 'date': '2022-12-06 15:02:00', 'title': 'HASBRO ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON COMMON SHARES', 'text': 'PAWTUCKET, R.I.--( BUSINESS WIRE )-- HASBRO, INC. (NASDAQ: HAS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.70 PER COMMON SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 15, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEBRUARY 1, 2023.'}